      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mutu ni lazima aogophe sirikali itawalayo. Mana uwezo wa kutawala ula kpwa Mlungu, nao atawala nkutsambulwa ni Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo mutu yeyesi apingaye uwezo wa sirikali, anampinga Mlungu ariyetsambula iyo sirikali. Naye apingaye sirikali anadziendzera kuamulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mtawala katishira mutu ahendaye manono, ela ahendaye mai. Phahi ichikala unalonda usitishirwe ni mtawala, henda manono, naye andakutogola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mtawala ni mtumishi wa Mlungu, naye anahenda kazi kpwa fwaidayo. Ela uchihenda mai, phahi dziondoke! Mana hakika hiye mtawala ana uwezo wa kukutiya adabu, naye nkukala anahenda kazi ya Mlungu kama vyohewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, atu ni lazima aogophe atawala, siyo kpwa sababu ya kuogopha kutiywa adabu tu, ela piya kpwa sababu mnamanya sawa ni muhende hivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
